<EpilineCaseLayout title="Epiline CRM and booking case" description="How RM CREATIVES connected Kommo CRM and Altegio to manage the journey from lead to appointment." eyebrow="CRM / ONLINE BOOKING" headline="A lead isn’t" accent="an appointment." intro="Marketing creates potential patients. Booking software manages appointments. We connected the missing layer between the two." metrics={[{value:'KOMMO',label:'lead management + follow-up'},{value:'ALTEGIO',label:'appointments + customer records'},{value:'1 flow',label:'from enquiry to booking'}]}>
<section class="case-section shell"><div class="two"><span class="eyebrow">THE GAP</span><div><h2>What happens after<br/>the form is submitted?</h2><p class="statement">A new enquiry is not yet a customer and not yet an appointment.</p><p>Altegio is excellent at schedules, appointments and existing customer records. But before a person books, the clinic still has to call them, answer questions, follow up later and remember what needs to happen next.</p><p>That work belongs in a lead-management system.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="case-section accent"><div class="shell"><span class="eyebrow">THE WORKFLOW</span><h2>One journey.<br/>Two systems.</h2><div class="flow"><span>AD / WEBSITE</span><b>→</b><span>NEW LEAD</span><b>→</b><span>KOMMO CRM</span><b>→</b><span>MANAGER</span><b>→</b><span>FOLLOW-UP</span><b>→</b><span>BOOKING</span><b>→</b><span>ALTEGIO</span></div></div></section>
<section class="case-section shell"><div class="two"><span class="eyebrow">WHY BOTH?</span><div><h2>Different tools.<br/>Different jobs.</h2><div class="data-list"><div class="data-row"><span>New marketing enquiry</span><span>Potential patient</span><strong>KOMMO</strong></div><div class="data-row"><span>Call / follow-up</span><span>Tasks and reminders</span><strong>KOMMO</strong></div><div class="data-row"><span>Create appointment</span><span>Manager can book from CRM</span><strong>KOMMO → ALTEGIO</strong></div><div class="data-row"><span>Schedule / appointment</span><span>Booked customer</span><strong>ALTEGIO</strong></div></div><p>The manager can create the Altegio appointment directly while working with the lead in Kommo, without losing the follow-up context around that potential patient.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="case-section dark"><div class="shell two"><span class="eyebrow">THE RESULT</span><div><h2>Marketing no longer ends<br/>at “lead received”.</h2><p class="statement">We closed the operational gap between acquisition and booking.</p><p>Advertising can generate demand, but the business only benefits if the clinic can work that demand properly. CRM and booking therefore became part of the same acquisition system rather than separate software tools.</p></div></div></section>
</EpilineCaseLayout>